CFFTest.sfd is a FontForge file for creating CFFTest.otf, a custom OpenType
font for testing the golang.org/x/image/font/sfnt package's CFF support.

To regenerate FreeType embolden expected images used by
font/opentype/TestFaceGlyphEmboldenFreeTypeExpected and the embolden demo image,
run:

	./font/testdata/generate-freetype-embolden-images.sh

This command regenerates:
	- font/testdata/freetype-embolden-A..Z-12px.png
	- testdata/font-embolden-demo.png
	- testdata/font-embolden-mixed-demo.png

Generator conditions (for reproducibility):
	- Input font: golang.org/x/image/font/gofont/goregular.TTF
	- FreeType render settings: FT_LOAD_NO_HINTING, FT_RENDER_MODE_NORMAL
	- FreeType embolden settings: FT_Outline_EmboldenXY(..., 64, 64)
	- Pixel size: 12
	- Test comparison placement baseline: Dot=(20, 55)
